  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The exhaust follows the bullet, so if you spin quickly enough, weaponized gunpowder can go anywhere!</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dragoon clip technique, eponymous addition technique</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The cones of energy created by the eponymous addition technique and the escalated version of the dragoon clip technique may now be pointed in any direction.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> The cones of energy created by the eponymous addition technique and the escalated version of the dragoon clip technique must be pointed in the same direction as a line drawn from you to the intended target of your firearm.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/triggerman-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
